        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "0dc7ab3d-871c-58bd-ad27-bed917d43b49",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sam Cassell, Robert Horry, Rex Chapman, Isaiah Thomas\n- Teams: Minnesota Timberwolves, Phoenix Suns, Houston Rockets, Boston Celtics\n- Seasons: 1996–97 Phoenix Suns season, 2003–04 NBA season, 2004–05 Minnesota Timberwolves season\n- Awards: NBA All-Star Game, All-NBA Team\n\nFacts:\n- During the 1996 offseason, the Phoenix Suns acquired Sam Cassell and Robert Horry from the Houston Rockets.\n- During the 1996 offseason, the Phoenix Suns signed free agent Rex Chapman.\n- In the 2003–04 season, Sam Cassell was selected to the NBA All-Star Game and the All-NBA Team, and those were his only selections for both honors.\n- The 2004–05 NBA season was the 16th season for the Minnesota Timberwolves in the National Basketball Association.\n- In February 2015, the Boston Celtics acquired Isaiah Thomas.\n- Isaiah Thomas earned NBA All-Star selections in 2016 and 2017.\n- In 2017, Isaiah Thomas earned All-NBA Team honors after helping the Boston Celtics finish first in the Eastern Conference.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
